# KG Access Contract

## Who can read
All workers: query_kg_nodes, query_kg_edges

## Who can write
story_state_manager only: add_kg_node, update_kg_node, add_kg_edge,
update_kg_edge, detect_kg_contradiction, init_kg_db

resolution_subagent: add_kg_node, update_kg_node, add_kg_edge,
update_kg_edge (targeted resolution writes only, no detect or init)

## Field name contract
CORRECT                    WRONG
logical_id                 character_id, pov_character_id, node_id, id
from                       from_node, from_id, source
to                         to_node, to_id, target
as_of_chapter              chapter, at_chapter, chapter_number
properties.voice_profile   voice_profile (top level), properties.voice

## Temporal versioning
Every node and edge has valid_from (int) and valid_to (int or null).
Active records have valid_to = null.
Querying without as_of_chapter returns records where valid_to = null.
Querying with as_of_chapter=N returns records where:
  valid_from <= N AND (valid_to IS NULL OR valid_to > N)

## voice_profile co-location
The voice profile is stored as properties.voice_profile on the Character
node — not as a separate node, not as a separate query.
Retrieve it in the same query_kg_nodes call as the psychological record.
If properties.voice_profile is absent on a pov_eligible character,
return status: "need_input". Do not proceed without it.

## Execution order in every worker skill invocation
1. Run ALL required KG queries first
2. Load skill file via progressive_skill_loader
3. Generate output using KG results + skill content
4. Return WorkerResponse with structured artifacts

Never interleave KG queries with reasoning or skill loading.
